    "reviews": "\u201cHell Let Loose's complex interplay of FPS action and real-time tactical planning rewards communication, coordination, and genuine leadership in a way few other games even attempt\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 PCGamesN<br><br>\u201cWith a deep layer of big-picture strategy and maps that perfectly capture the devastation of war, there are few games in the genre that bring so much to the blood-soaked table.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 NME<br><br>\u201cThe best World War II shooter for years\u201d<br>86% \u2013 Gamestar<br>",
